{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witch's Apocalyptic Journey</strong> is a multiplayer cooperative roguelite deckbuilding game with role-playing elements. You can customize the daily schedule of the witches, and create your own unique <strong>Super Cards</strong>! Team up with your friends to form a witch squad and destroy this world!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.poster.avif?t=1768706396\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.webm?t=1768706396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.mp4?t=1768706396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The witches, symbols of ominous, are the very stars of disaster. In Aldrin, their presence means only one thing: the world is on the brink of its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0 They are both executioners and undertakers, guiding their steps as they're about to deliver the world its final rites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/95903be8e5311ef4781c94936b10ea37.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/811fd1ddd7c36bc055d1834d188c5aed.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/811fd1ddd7c36bc055d1834d188c5aed.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Recruit a witch squad of up to four members to experience the fun of strategic deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>You can also recruit other NPCs at events to bolster your strength. Death is not the end \u2014 a single heal and you're ready to back to the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/532908d7dbfa5703ace2ca5593d99d39.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/8d8b1ca42bebf3b1326d2fccdc4d94e7.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/8d8b1ca42bebf3b1326d2fccdc4d94e7.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0In addition to the cards appeared in the game, you\u2019ll have the opportunity to acquire <strong>blank cards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Write down your own unique magical combination on these blank cards to create your very own custom <strong>super card</strong>\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Don\u2019t want one card to appear in your deck...? Replace it with one of your <strong>super cards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/a7e51133e0a8eb1169850c6a8c48954e.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b1fb8545cd82f893f4a2802f0d60d012.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/b1fb8545cd82f893f4a2802f0d60d012.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The witches cannot reverse time, but they can manipulate karma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You can customize the events the witches will encounter by drawing a certain number of Fate Cards on the map interface and arranging them along the timeline according to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Once the route is set, the witches will follow your planned course, and some ingenious combinations might lead to unexpected twists along the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/1f8532a79c1ee8776ec73aadacb3d2be.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/9640541ad97fee3bf8b99c8d1b032ef9.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/9640541ad97fee3bf8b99c8d1b032ef9.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You will acquire a variety of resources to strengthen your witches in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Construct your basic deck with cards, build your genre with relics, and strengthen your attributes with blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You will encounter enemies with different special abilities. Counter or be countered, it depends on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/1958811f1aa16108ed37ae9d99db7524.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/3a9230da11d17ba2cd4ef5a03662fc1e.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/3a9230da11d17ba2cd4ef5a03662fc1e.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Use the <strong>Crystal of Truth</strong> obtained during your adventures to buy materials in the Witch's House, then craft them into new items at the Alchemy Table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Alchemy items can enchant your cards, temporarily altering their effects for one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>Create a 0-cost card to cycle through your deck, or concentrate all damage on a single card to create a &quot;magic bomb&quot;, where resources become your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>MODs and Workshop</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After game launches, we'll open up the Workshop, allowing players to experience a variety of witches' worlds, adding new cards, customizing the appearances of the witches, and designing more quests, keep infusing the witches' world with more and more vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X\uff1a@WitchApoc_EN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Add to Wishlist! Adventure alongside the Witches!\u3011</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709430?t=1768706396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709430?t=1768706396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/d3a5ee54326a57419920e0a5fe64d7468d961029/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768706396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/d3a5ee54326a57419920e0a5fe64d7468d961029/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768706396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains some revealing outfits."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Witch's Apocalyptic Journey</strong> is a multiplayer cooperative roguelite deckbuilding game with role-playing elements. You can customize the daily schedule of the witches, and create your own unique <strong>Super Cards</strong>! Team up with your friends to form a witch squad and destroy this world!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.poster.avif?t=1768706396\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.webm?t=1768706396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/2d1352a7349d3cc25d280176dbac6c61.mp4?t=1768706396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The witches, symbols of ominous, are the very stars of disaster. In Aldrin, their presence means only one thing: the world is on the brink of its end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0 They are both executioners and undertakers, guiding their steps as they're about to deliver the world its final rites!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/95903be8e5311ef4781c94936b10ea37.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/811fd1ddd7c36bc055d1834d188c5aed.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/811fd1ddd7c36bc055d1834d188c5aed.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=297 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Recruit a witch squad of up to four members to experience the fun of strategic deckbuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>You can also recruit other NPCs at events to bolster your strength. Death is not the end \u2014 a single heal and you're ready to back to the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/532908d7dbfa5703ace2ca5593d99d39.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/8d8b1ca42bebf3b1326d2fccdc4d94e7.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/8d8b1ca42bebf3b1326d2fccdc4d94e7.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0In addition to the cards appeared in the game, you\u2019ll have the opportunity to acquire <strong>blank cards</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Write down your own unique magical combination on these blank cards to create your very own custom <strong>super card</strong>\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Don\u2019t want one card to appear in your deck...? Replace it with one of your <strong>super cards</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/a7e51133e0a8eb1169850c6a8c48954e.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b1fb8545cd82f893f4a2802f0d60d012.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/b1fb8545cd82f893f4a2802f0d60d012.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0The witches cannot reverse time, but they can manipulate karma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You can customize the events the witches will encounter by drawing a certain number of Fate Cards on the map interface and arranging them along the timeline according to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Once the route is set, the witches will follow your planned course, and some ingenious combinations might lead to unexpected twists along the journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/1f8532a79c1ee8776ec73aadacb3d2be.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/9640541ad97fee3bf8b99c8d1b032ef9.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/9640541ad97fee3bf8b99c8d1b032ef9.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You will acquire a variety of resources to strengthen your witches in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Construct your basic deck with cards, build your genre with relics, and strengthen your attributes with blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0You will encounter enemies with different special abilities. Counter or be countered, it depends on your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/1958811f1aa16108ed37ae9d99db7524.avif?t=1768706396\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/3a9230da11d17ba2cd4ef5a03662fc1e.avif?t=1768706396\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras_big/3a9230da11d17ba2cd4ef5a03662fc1e.avif?t=1768706396 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Use the <strong>Crystal of Truth</strong> obtained during your adventures to buy materials in the Witch's House, then craft them into new items at the Alchemy Table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>\u00a0Alchemy items can enchant your cards, temporarily altering their effects for one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/extras/b88a69e5923454b8c0772e25ef644d21.avif?t=1768706396\" width=17 height=21 /></span>Create a 0-cost card to cycle through your deck, or concentrate all damage on a single card to create a &quot;magic bomb&quot;, where resources become your power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>MODs and Workshop</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After game launches, we'll open up the Workshop, allowing players to experience a variety of witches' worlds, adding new cards, customizing the appearances of the witches, and designing more quests, keep infusing the witches' world with more and more vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X\uff1a@WitchApoc_EN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Add to Wishlist! Adventure alongside the Witches!\u3011</p>","developers":["MeowAlive"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709430/2f476401eae01a8b9b514dbef16d38c06d3dd1ea/header.jpg?t=1768706396","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOs v11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709430/1435096280/b457d33c4e1d6252010105faee57e39ac495b187/1768374007/dash_av1.