es. Craft unique cards, schedule their days, shape endless possibilities through deckbuilding. Each choice will lead to different Ending...","steam_appid":3709430,"support_info":{"email":"meowstudio@yeah.net","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}